    <string-array name="puzzle_story">
        <item>Guan Yu, blade across his horse, lets Cao Cao go at Huarong Trail.</item>
        <item>Soldiers stand at both sides of Cao Cao.</item>
        <item>Four soldiers in one line, side by side.</item>
        <item>Cao Cao in command, guards all around.</item>
        <item>The generals keep Cao Cao boxed in, as in a walled garden.</item>
        <item>The troops split into three roads.</item>
